            "approve": true,
            "description": "# CCE IaC ↔ application alignment (optional)\n\nWhen `application_repo_url` is provided as an input, clone it on the execution\nhost and run CCE with `CCE_USE_CASE=iac-alignment` (or the built-in cloud scan)\nbefore final Terraform validation.\n\n1. Clone the app repo to `$WORK_ROOT/app-repo`.\n2. Run `cce-scan.sh` per the `CCE_PACK_*` environment.\n3. Compare entitlement `provider`/`resource` signals to the Terraform resource types in the state groups — record mismatches as `cce_iac_alignment_summary`.\n\nSkip when `application_repo_url` is empty or `SKIP_CCE=1`.",
            "id": "767e9f1f-92e9-5e23-a998-12ebde5289ac",
