              "Fetch source_iac_branch=fixture/opa-gcp-source-mini from cloud-migrator, generate Azure IaC, validate it, and open a PR"
            ],
            "id": "8867994f-14a9-5bbf-92fb-4518157d81db",
            "metadata": {
