                "note": "**Upstream guard:** if `azure_migration_blueprint_ok` is not `\"true\"`, record `stage_summary:azure-iac-generate=skipped:blueprint_missing` and return.\n**Incremental bring-up execution (mandatory):** `create_agent` is allowed (reactree). Put the exact BEGIN/END one-liner in CREATE_AGENT_EXPECTATION (`tool_names` only execute_series), or paste it yourself. ONE `nile-runner_execute_series` whose single command is ONLY the shell script between ---BEGIN AZURE_GENERATE_EXECUTE_SERIES--- and ---END AZURE_GENERATE_EXECUTE_SERIES--- below (never use the marker label as the command).\n**Mapping rule:** use the default profile without waiting for routine choices. For each unsupported/placeholder/low-confidence/profile-only AWS type, perform the `web_search` + Terraform Registry research described above; search both AzureRM resources/data sources and reusable modules at pinned versions, inspect provider/module schemas and composition, and record candidate evidence, source observations, mismatches, search terms/URLs, confidence, and disposition in `azure/artifacts/mapping-research.md`. Implement evidence-backed improvements in the run's catalog/generator copy under `$WORK_ROOT/scripts/` (or per-run blueprint/HCL where justified), add a regression fixture for reusable changes, then rerun deterministic generation. Do not stop on the first `source_coverage_below_90_percent`: read `generation-summary.json` uncovered source types/counts, investigate likely candidates with web_search/Registry, improve the evidence-backed mapping/emission, and re-run coverage. Repeat this bounded repair pass until coverage passes or the evidence shows 90% is not safely attainable; in the latter case return a clear blocked result and research artifact rather than fake the gate or open a below-threshold PR. Keep residual semantics in `review-needed.md`; never block on human approval alone. Explicit non-applicable instances are reported separately, while unsupported/unresolved/missing target instances stay uncovered. Generate HCL only under `$WORK_ROOT/azure/groups/\u003cgroup_id\u003e/`.\n**Hard evidence gate:** completion requires a successful runner result with `azure_iac_generated=true` and `azure_iac_group_count` greater than zero. Absent those, record `stage_summary:azure-iac-generate=blocked:missing_runner_evidence` and return blocked.\n**Outputs:** on pass, note `azure_iac_generated=true`, `azure_iac_group_count`, `azure_source_coverage_rate`, `azure_source_coverage_ok=true`, `azure_generation_summary_path`, `azure_mapping_decisions_path`, and `stage_summary:azure-iac-generate=ok`. Below 90% is a conclusive blocked outcome, not a generated-success note. Preserve `azure/artifacts/mapping-research.md` alongside generation artifacts.\n\nworkflow_run_id: {{workflow_run_id}}\nWORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nABS_WORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nrunner_work_home: /home/runner\nremote_runner_name: nile-runner\nshell_tool_prefix: nile-runner\nscript_pack_version: 20260930.05\nscript_pack_preload_dir: /opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05\n\n\n---BEGIN AZURE_GENERATE_EXECUTE_SERIES---\nexport WORKFLOW_RUN_ID='{{workflow_run_id}}' DBSPLIT_EMBEDDED=1 GIT_TOKEN=\"${GIT_TOKEN:-${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GH_TOKEN:-${token:-}}}}\"; export GIT_TOKEN; export GH_TOKEN=\"${GH_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GITHUB_TOKEN=\"${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0; unset AWS_PROFILE; rm -rf \"${HOME}/.aws/cli/cache\" \"${HOME}/.aws/sso\" 2\u003e/dev/null || true; echo \"aws_env_keys=$(env | grep '^AWS_' | cut -d= -f1 | tr '\\n' ' ')\"; if [ -f \"${HOME}/.aws/credentials\" ]; then echo aws_credentials_file=present; else echo aws_credentials_file=absent; fi; pack_entry(){ P='/opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05'; if [ -x \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" ]; then exec bash \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; fi; D=$(mktemp -d); gh release download 'pack-20260930.05' -R 'Walmart-StackGen/Nile-Factory' -p pack-entry.sh -D \"${D}\" \u0026\u0026 exec bash \"${D}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; }; pack_entry destination azure-iac-generate '{{workflow_run_id}}'\n\n---END AZURE_GENERATE_EXECUTE_SERIES---\n\n",
