              {
                "action_config": {},
                "action_type": "",
                "agent_ref": "aws-migrator-architect",
                "note": "Goal: confirm the remote runner has the tools and script pack this workflow needs.\nDone when: your stage result includes the runner lines `runner_capability_preflight_ok: \"true\"` and `script_pack_ready: \"true\"` (or `script_pack_fetch=ok` / `script_pack_preload_dir=/opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/…` from a real pack fetch).\nHow: ONE `nile-runner_execute_series` pasting the **exact** BEGIN/END `RUNNER_CAPABILITY_PREFLIGHT_EXECUTE_SERIES` body (starts with `GIT_TOKEN=` and `gh release download` of `pack-entry.sh`, ends with `preflight '{{workflow_run_id}}'`). create_agent is fine with that same body.\n**FORBIDDEN:** `printf` / `echo` of BEGIN/END markers; inventing `runner_capability_preflight_ok=true`; inventing `script_pack_dir_missing` / `fetch-script-pack.sh` / `runner_capability_preflight_blocked` checks; using the marker label as the command. Only the BEGIN/END body fetches the pack. Prefer working_dir omit or `/`.\nPrefer the pack command over inventing shell. Echo the runner success or blocker lines in your result; do not paraphrase them away.\n\nworkflow_run_id: {{workflow_run_id}}\nWORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nABS_WORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nrunner_work_home: /home/runner\nremote_runner_name: nile-runner\nshell_tool_prefix: nile-runner\nscript_pack_version: 20260930.05\nscript_pack_preload_dir: /opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05\n\nsubstitute: {{workflow_run_id}} → real id from the stagerunner header\nworking_dir: omit or /\ntimeout_seconds: 3600\n\n---BEGIN RUNNER_CAPABILITY_PREFLIGHT_EXECUTE_SERIES---\nGIT_TOKEN=\"${GIT_TOKEN:-${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GH_TOKEN:-${token:-}}}}\"; export GIT_TOKEN; export GH_TOKEN=\"${GH_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GITHUB_TOKEN=\"${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0; unset AWS_PROFILE; rm -rf \"${HOME}/.aws/cli/cache\" \"${HOME}/.aws/sso\" 2\u003e/dev/null || true; echo \"aws_env_keys=$(env | grep '^AWS_' | cut -d= -f1 | tr '\\n' ' ')\"; if [ -f \"${HOME}/.aws/credentials\" ]; then echo aws_credentials_file=present; else echo aws_credentials_file=absent; fi; pack_entry(){ P='/opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05'; if [ -x \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" ]; then exec bash \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; fi; D=$(mktemp -d); gh release download 'pack-20260930.05' -R 'Walmart-StackGen/Nile-Factory' -p pack-entry.sh -D \"${D}\" \u0026\u0026 exec bash \"${D}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; }; pack_entry preflight '{{workflow_run_id}}'\n---END RUNNER_CAPABILITY_PREFLIGHT_EXECUTE_SERIES---\n\n",
