                "agent_ref": "aws-migrator-architect",
                "note": "Goal: put every scanned resource into exactly one group folder, each with its own state file. Split-quality scores are optional.\nDone when: runner lines include `count_reconciliation_ok: \"true\"`, group paths, and `script_pack_verify_ok: \"true\"`.\nHow: prefer the BEGIN/END pack command in this note (one `nile-runner_execute_command`, working_dir `/`, full timeout). create_agent is fine with the same body. Do not ask the operator for the state path; do not invent shell; do not use GitHub or AWS MCP tools for this stage.\nOn `lock_error=timeout` / `blocked:split_lock_timeout`: re-run the same pack body once (dead holders are reclaimed). Do not write `count_reconciliation_ok=true` inside a \"not produced\" sentence. Echo runner lines; do not paraphrase them away.\n\nworkflow_run_id: {{workflow_run_id}}\nWORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nABS_WORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nrunner_work_home: /home/runner\nremote_runner_name: nile-runner\nshell_tool_prefix: nile-runner\nscript_pack_version: 20260930.05\nscript_pack_preload_dir: /opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05\n\nDBSPLIT_ALLOCATE_SHA256: 3649f202bfa2fc8b3a3504683dfa0e416743fcf397b8dea36b2709b87b2dfa29\nDBSPLIT_DECOMPOSER_SHA256: 6c6b1e653803e782ff5d2f249c3eec905c459bf5cc5e32d55efbfdcc8b309503\nINGEST_BOOTSTRAP_SHA256: c758ce04dd54e437656125361beecf4751d270a8238a61c14c8aa53eb432c315\nworking_dir: /\ntimeout_seconds: 3600\n\n---BEGIN INGEST_BOOTSTRAP_EXECUTE_COMMAND---\nGIT_TOKEN=\"${GIT_TOKEN:-${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GH_TOKEN:-${token:-}}}}\"; export GIT_TOKEN; export GH_TOKEN=\"${GH_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GITHUB_TOKEN=\"${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0; unset AWS_PROFILE; rm -rf \"${HOME}/.aws/cli/cache\" \"${HOME}/.aws/sso\" 2\u003e/dev/null || true; echo \"aws_env_keys=$(env | grep '^AWS_' | cut -d= -f1 | tr '\\n' ' ')\"; if [ -f \"${HOME}/.aws/credentials\" ]; then echo aws_credentials_file=present; else echo aws_credentials_file=absent; fi; pack_entry(){ P='/opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05'; if [ -x \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" ]; then exec bash \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; fi; D=$(mktemp -d); gh release download 'pack-20260930.05' -R 'Walmart-StackGen/Nile-Factory' -p pack-entry.sh -D \"${D}\" \u0026\u0026 exec bash \"${D}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; }; pack_entry ingest '{{workflow_run_id}}'\n---END INGEST_BOOTSTRAP_EXECUTE_COMMAND---\n\n",
                "parallel_agents": [],
                "runbook_refs": [
                  "aws-cloud-discovery-stage-contract-sop"
                ],
