        {
          "schema_version": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "approve": true,
            "description": "GCP migration PR workflow. Resolves a discovery handoff via `source_pr` (GitHub PR number) or\n`source_iac_branch` (head ref; default `fixture/opa-gcp-source-mini`), clones that tip from\n`https://github.com/Walmart-StackGen/Nile-Factory.git`, materializes `aws/groups` + `aws/artifacts`, then runs\nGCP blueprint → HCL generate → serial harden → validate → governance-conform → sibling multi-commit GCP PR (`gcp/\u003crun_id\u003e`) with living Nile Priority-1 + OPA evidence (residuals documented in TODO when not yet clear).\nSkips cloud2code, tfstate split, AWS reverse-HCL hydration, and orphan handling.\n",
            "domain": "infrastructure-as-code",
