                "note": "**Upstream guard:** Prefer notes showing `gcp_migration_blueprint_ok=true` / `stage_summary:gcp-migration-blueprint=ok`. Guild `read_notes` may mask those keys when blueprint/generate overlap on the same runner — do **not** invent `skipped:blueprint_missing` from an incomplete note snapshot. If blueprint already ran this workflow (or workdir `gcp/artifacts/migration-blueprint.json` exists with `group_count` \u003e 0), you MUST run execute_series.\n**Incremental bring-up execution (mandatory):** Your FIRST tool call must be ONE `nile-runner_execute_series` pasting the **exact** one-line body between `---BEGIN GCP_GENERATE_EXECUTE_SERIES---` and `---END---` (`pack-entry.sh` … `destination gcp-iac-generate`). **FORBIDDEN:** label-as-command or `$`/`${` expansion. Spawn a one-shot subagent if needed; never return without runner evidence.\n**Mapping rule:** use the default profile without asking for routine choices, but never equate a scaffold or `mapped` label with a completed migration. Follow `destination-iac-wiring-readiness` and reconcile actual AWS instances/attributes/relationships through catalog → resolver → emitted HCL → pinned provider schema. For every unsupported/placeholder/low-confidence/profile-only type, actively use `web_search` and Terraform Registry provider/resource/data-source **and module** search. Inspect the pinned Google provider docs and candidate module source, version, inputs/outputs, provider constraints, maintenance, and local-root fit; name similarity or a Registry hit is not evidence of equivalence. Record candidate resources/modules, search terms/URLs, observed source values, semantic fit/mismatches, confidence, and disposition in `gcp/artifacts/mapping-research.md`. For reusable gaps, make evidence-backed catalog/generator edits in `$WORK_ROOT/scripts/`, add source-state + emitted-HCL assertions, and rerun deterministic generation/coverage. When the 90% gate fails, do not return immediately: analyze `infra_conversion_gaps` / uncovered source counts, research those types, improve the mapping/emission in a bounded repair loop, and recompute coverage. Continue until ≥90% or evidence proves that threshold cannot be safely met; then return a blocked status with researched gaps/artifact, never fake coverage or open a failing PR. Count intentional non-applicable separately; unsupported, unresolved, or un-emitted sources stay uncovered. Generate HCL only under `$WORK_ROOT/gcp/groups/\u003cgroup_id\u003e/`.\n**Hard evidence gate:** completion requires a successful runner result with `gcp_iac_generated=true` and `gcp_iac_group_count` greater than zero. Absent those, record `stage_summary:gcp-iac-generate=blocked:missing_runner_evidence` and return blocked.\n**Discrete session notes (mandatory):** only on coverage pass, `note()` keys `gcp_iac_generated`=`true`, `gcp_iac_group_count`=`\u003cN\u003e`, `gcp_source_coverage_rate`=`\u003crate\u003e`, `gcp_source_coverage_ok`=`true`, `stage_summary:gcp-iac-generate`=`ok`. Under 90% is conclusive blocked evidence; do not record generated=true.\n**Outputs:** discrete notes above plus `gcp_generation_summary_path`, `gcp_mapping_decisions_path`; preserve `gcp/artifacts/mapping-research.md` alongside generation artifacts.\n\nworkflow_run_id: {{workflow_run_id}}\nWORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nABS_WORK_ROOT: /home/runner/.{{workflow_run_id}}\nrunner_work_home: /home/runner\nremote_runner_name: nile-runner\nshell_tool_prefix: nile-runner\nscript_pack_version: 20260930.05\nscript_pack_preload_dir: /opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05\n\n\n---BEGIN GCP_GENERATE_EXECUTE_SERIES---\nexport WORKFLOW_RUN_ID='{{workflow_run_id}}' DBSPLIT_EMBEDDED=1 GIT_TOKEN=\"${GIT_TOKEN:-${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GH_TOKEN:-${token:-}}}}\"; export GIT_TOKEN; export GH_TOKEN=\"${GH_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GITHUB_TOKEN=\"${GITHUB_TOKEN:-${GIT_TOKEN}}\"; export GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0; unset AWS_PROFILE; rm -rf \"${HOME}/.aws/cli/cache\" \"${HOME}/.aws/sso\" 2\u003e/dev/null || true; echo \"aws_env_keys=$(env | grep '^AWS_' | cut -d= -f1 | tr '\\n' ' ')\"; if [ -f \"${HOME}/.aws/credentials\" ]; then echo aws_credentials_file=present; else echo aws_credentials_file=absent; fi; pack_entry(){ P='/opt/aws-migrator/script-pack/20260930.05'; if [ -x \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" ]; then exec bash \"${P}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; fi; D=$(mktemp -d); gh release download 'pack-20260930.05' -R 'Walmart-StackGen/Nile-Factory' -p pack-entry.sh -D \"${D}\" \u0026\u0026 exec bash \"${D}/pack-entry.sh\" \"$@\"; }; pack_entry destination gcp-iac-generate '{{workflow_run_id}}'\n\n---END GCP_GENERATE_EXECUTE_SERIES---\n\n",
